<title>ISRAEL: ISRAEL'S INDUSTRIAL BUILDING Q2 NET UP.</title>
<headline>ISRAEL'S INDUSTRIAL BUILDING Q2 NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Building Corp reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q2 97    Q2 96	6-MTH 97    6-MTH 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  48,931   45,289     96,953	90,509</p>
<p>Operating Profit     28,555   25,438     55,272	50,150</p>
<p>Net Profit	     18,369   16,743     35,390	24,952</p>
<p>($1 = 3.53 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
